do_1 = "Decision 2490 (triage record spec/layerx-merge/programme/issues/1567.kvx, verdict task): the newHeads publication for Autobahn-committed blocks (rpc/subscribe.go:129-161 and 520-553) receives the header forwarded by consensus/internal/p2p/giga_router.go:331-351 before node/app.go:1952-1957 and node/abci.go:318-326 have filled its receipts, state and transactions roots, so subscribers see zero roots. Publish the header only after the roots are populated (publish from the committed-block path that holds the finished header, or fill the roots before forwarding); the producer is the real block commit path, not a copied header."
do_2 = "Extend TestSubscribeNewHeadsAutobahn in rpc/subscribe_test.go (line 120) to assert the published header's receiptsRoot, stateRoot and transactionsRoot are the committed block's non-zero roots; keep TestSubscribeNewHeads (line 44) passing; never weaken either test."
